  "application_type_full": "Prior Approval: Change of use - retail/service/takeaway/etc to dwellinghouses",
  "description": "The proposed development is a change of use at 112 Brackenbury Road W6 where there is mixed use already and the front door serves both the domestic rated ground and basement flat and the commercially rated shopfront area. The change of use is required to change the commercial rated areas to domestic use. It is proposed that this comes under the Sui generis label  as the property is unusual in its mixed use mostly because it has been unchanged and has been restored not developed. The property maintains all it's period features and there is adequate natural light in all habitable rooms of the dwelling house as the shop frontage window and door and the sash windows are all in keeping with the dwelling as a whole and would not be changed.",
